      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:00.00",
      "end_raw": "00:03.00",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 3000,
      "text": "High angle wide shot looking down at the muddy, trampled garden. Broken wooden planters and splintered planks litter the ground as Juliana kneels amidst the ruined soil.",
      "line_number": 14,
      "duration_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP017_B002",
      "episode_id": "EP017",
      "file_index": 1,
      "scene_id": "EP017_S01",
      "block_type": "ACTION",
      "label_raw": "ACTION",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:00.00",
      "end_raw": "00:03.00",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 3000,
      "text": "Juliana sits on her knees in her dirt-smudged dress, her hands wrapped in clean linen bandages, sorrowfully examining the wreckage. In the distant background, Alexander paces near the perimeter fence.",
      "line_number": 18,
      "duration_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP017_B003",
      "episode_id": "EP017",
      "file_index": 2,
      "scene_id": "EP017_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:03.00",
      "end_raw": "00:07.00",
      "start_ms": 3000,
      "end_ms": 7000,
      "text": "Close-up on Juliana's bandaged hand reaching into the dark earth of a battered planter box.",
      "line_number": 22,
      "duration_ms": 4000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP017_B004",
      "episode_id": "EP017",
      "file_index": 3,
      "scene_id": "EP017_S01",
      "block_type": "ACTION",
      "label_raw": "ACTION",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:03.00",
      "end_raw": "00:07.00",
      "start_ms": 3000,
      "end_ms": 7000,
      "text": "Juliana gently lifts a tiny, delicate white daisy clinging to its exposed roots out of the soil, cupping it in her palm.",
      "line_number": 26,
      "duration_ms": 4000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP017_B005",
      "episode_id": "EP017",
      "file_index": 4,
      "scene_id": "EP017_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:07.00",
      "end_raw": "00:11.50",
      "start_ms": 7000,
      "end_ms": 11500,
      "text": "Medium close-up tilting up to Juliana's face, bruised and tear-streaked yet filled with fragile hope.",
      "line_number": 30,
      "duration_ms": 4500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP017_B006",
      "episode_id": "EP017",
      "file_index": 5,
      "scene_id": "EP017_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "JULIANA (Soft, Emotional)",
      "speaker": "JULIANA",
      "delivery": [
        "Soft",
        "Emotional"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:09.30",
      "end_raw": "00:11.30",
      "start_ms": 9300,
      "end_ms": 11300,
      "text": "\"Some of them survived.\"",
      "line_number": 34,
      "duration_ms": 2000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP017_B007",
      "episode_id": "EP017",
      "file_index": 6,
      "scene_id": "EP017_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:11.50",
      "end_raw": "00:14.00",
      "start_ms": 11500,
      "end_ms": 14000,
      "text": "Low-angle medium shot of Alexander repairing the broken wooden fence with a heavy iron hammer.",
      "line_number": 38,
      "duration_ms": 2500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP017_B008",
      "episode_id": "EP017",
      "file_index": 7,
      "scene_id": "EP017_S01",
      "block_type": "SOUND_FX",
      "label_raw": "SOUND FX",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:11.50",
      "end_raw": "00:14.00",
      "start_ms": 11500,
      "end_ms": 14000,
      "text": "Rhythmic, heavy thuds of an iron hammer pounding into weathered wood.",
      "line_number": 42,
      "duration_ms": 2500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP017_B009",
      "episode_id": "EP017",
      "file_index": 8,
      "scene_id": "EP017_S01",
      "block_type": "ACTION",
      "label_raw": "ACTION",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:11.50",
      "end_raw": "00:14.00",
      "start_ms": 11500,
      "end_ms": 14000,
      "text": "Alexander firmly drives nails into a fractured fence post, his brow furrowed with focused determination.",
      "line_number": 46,
      "duration_ms": 2500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP017_B010",
      "episode_id": "EP017",
      "file_index": 9,
      "scene_id": "EP017_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:14.00",
      "end_raw": "00:16.20",
      "start_ms": 14000,
      "end_ms": 16200,
      "text": "Wide shot framing Juliana kneeling on the wet cobblestones in the foreground while Alexander stands by the fence behind her, lowering his hammer.",
      "line_number": 50,
      "duration_ms": 2200
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP017_B011",
      "episode_id": "EP017",
      "file_index": 10,
      "scene_id": "EP017_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "JULIANA (Grateful, Sincere)",
      "speaker": "JULIANA",
      "delivery": [
        "Grateful",
        "Sincere"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:14.30",
      "end_raw": "00:15.30",
      "start_ms": 14300,
      "end_ms": 15300,
      "text": "\"Thank you.\"",
      "line_number": 54,
      "duration_ms": 1000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP017_B012",
      "episode_id": "EP017",
      "file_index": 11,
      "scene_id": "EP017_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:16.20",
      "end_raw": "00:18.00",
      "start_ms": 16200,
      "end_ms": 18000,
      "text": "Close-up of Alexander turning toward her, his scarred face stoic and intense.",
      "line_number": 58,
      "duration_ms": 1800
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP017_B013",
      "episode_id": "EP017",
      "file_index": 12,
      "scene_id": "EP017_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "ALEXANDER (Gruff, Low)",
      "speaker": "ALEXANDER",
      "delivery": [
        "Gruff",
        "Low"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:16.80",
      "end_raw": "00:17.80",
      "start_ms": 16800,
      "end_ms": 17800,
      "text": "\"For what?\"",
      "line_number": 62,
      "duration_ms": 1000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP017_B014",
      "episode_id": "EP017",
      "file_index": 13,
      "scene_id": "EP017_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:18.00",
      "end_raw": "00:21.00",
      "start_ms": 18000,
      "end_ms": 21000,
      "text": "Close-up of Juliana looking up at him with deep emotional vulnerability, her eyes shimmering with tears.",
      "line_number": 66,
      "duration_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP017_B015",
      "episode_id": "EP017",
      "file_index": 14,
      "scene_id": "EP017_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "JULIANA (Trembling, Heartfelt)",
      "speaker": "JULIANA",
      "delivery": [
        "Trembling",
        "Heartfelt"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:18.20",
      "end_raw": "00:20.50",
      "start_ms": 18200,
      "end_ms": 20500,
      "text": "\"For standing between me and those men.\"",
      "line_number": 70,
      "duration_ms": 2300
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP017_B016",
      "episode_id": "EP017",
      "file_index": 15,
      "scene_id": "EP017_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:21.00",
      "end_raw": "00:23.50",
      "start_ms": 21000,
      "end_ms": 23500,
      "text": "Close-up of Alexander, his piercing blue-grey eyes fixed upon her with absolute conviction.",
      "line_number": 74,
      "duration_ms": 2500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP017_B017",
      "episode_id": "EP017",
      "file_index": 16,
      "scene_id": "EP017_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "ALEXANDER (Unwavering, Firm)",
      "speaker": "ALEXANDER",
      "delivery": [
        "Unwavering",
        "Firm"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:21.50",
      "end_raw": "00:23.00",
      "start_ms": 21500,
      "end_ms": 23000,
      "text": "\"I would do it again.\"",
      "line_number": 78,
      "duration_ms": 1500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP017_B018",
      "episode_id": "EP017",
      "file_index": 17,
      "scene_id": "EP017_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:23.50",
      "end_raw": "00:25.80",
      "start_ms": 23500,
      "end_ms": 25800,
      "text": "Close-up of Juliana, her lips parting as her voice wavers with emotion.",
      "line_number": 82,
      "duration_ms": 2300
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP017_B019",
      "episode_id": "EP017",
      "file_index": 18,
      "scene_id": "EP017_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "JULIANA (Whispering, Awed)",
      "speaker": "JULIANA",
      "delivery": [
        "Whispering",
        "Awed"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:24.00",
      "end_raw": "00:25.70",
      "start_ms": 24000,
      "end_ms": 25700,
      "text": "\"Even if there were ten of them?\"",
      "line_number": 86,
      "duration_ms": 1700
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP017_B020",
      "episode_id": "EP017",
      "file_index": 19,
      "scene_id": "EP017_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "ALEXANDER (Deep, Resolute)",
      "speaker": "ALEXANDER",
      "delivery": [
        "Deep",
        "Resolute"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:26.00",
      "end_raw": "00:27.70",
      "start_ms": 26000,
      "end_ms": 27700,
      "text": "\"As long as I draw breath...\"",
      "line_number": 90,
      "duration_ms": 1700
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP017_B021",
      "episode_id": "EP017",
      "file_index": 20,
      "scene_id": "EP017_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:26.50",
      "end_raw": "00:30.00",
      "start_ms": 26500,
      "end_ms": 30000,
      "text": "Tracking shot following Alexander as he strides across the muddy garden and approaches Juliana.",
      "line_number": 94,
      "duration_ms": 3500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP017_B022",
      "episode_id": "EP017",
      "file_index": 21,
      "scene_id": "EP017_S01",
      "block_type": "ACTION",
      "label_raw": "ACTION",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:28.00",
      "end_raw": "00:31.50",
      "start_ms": 28000,
      "end_ms": 31500,
      "text": "Alexander drops to one knee before Juliana, gently taking her trembling, bandaged hands into his large, weathered palms.",
      "line_number": 98,
      "duration_ms": 3500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP017_B023",
      "episode_id": "EP017",
      "file_index": 22,
      "scene_id": "EP017_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "ALEXANDER (Gentle, Vowing)",
      "speaker": "ALEXANDER",
      "delivery": [
        "Gentle",
        "Vowing"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:28.80",
      "end_raw": "00:31.00",
      "start_ms": 28800,
      "end_ms": 31000,
      "text": "\"...no one will hurt you again.\"",
      "line_number": 102,
      "duration_ms": 2200
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP017_B024",
      "episode_id": "EP017",
      "file_index": 23,
      "scene_id": "EP017_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:31.50",
      "end_raw": "00:34.50",
      "start_ms": 31500,
      "end_ms": 34500,
      "text": "Close-up on Juliana's tear-filled face, overwhelmed by his fierce devotion.",
      "line_number": 106,
      "duration_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP017_B025",
      "episode_id": "EP017",
      "file_index": 24,
      "scene_id": "EP017_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "JULIANA (Choked Up, Pained)",
      "speaker": "JULIANA",
      "delivery": [
        "Choked Up",
        "Pained"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:32.80",
      "end_raw": "00:34.20",
      "start_ms": 32800,
      "end_ms": 34200,
      "text": "\"You cannot promise that.\"",
      "line_number": 110,
      "duration_ms": 1400
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP017_B026",
      "episode_id": "EP017",
      "file_index": 25,
      "scene_id": "EP017_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:34.50",
      "end_raw": "00:36.50",
      "start_ms": 34500,
      "end_ms": 36500,
      "text": "Extreme close-up of Alexander's intense, protective gaze locking onto hers.",
      "line_number": 114,
      "duration_ms": 2000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP017_B027",
      "episode_id": "EP017",
      "file_index": 26,
      "scene_id": "EP017_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "ALEXANDER (Quiet, Absolute)",
      "speaker": "ALEXANDER",
      "delivery": [
        "Quiet",
        "Absolute"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:34.80",
      "end_raw": "00:35.80",
      "start_ms": 34800,
      "end_ms": 35800,
      "text": "\"I just did.\"",
      "line_number": 118,
      "duration_ms": 1000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP017_B028",
      "episode_id": "EP017",
      "file_index": 27,
      "scene_id": "EP017_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:36.50",
      "end_raw": "00:39.00",
      "start_ms": 36500,
      "end_ms": 39000,
      "text": "Close-up of their joined hands, his rugged, scarred fingers wrapping securely around her bandaged fingers.",
      "line_number": 122,
      "duration_ms": 2500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP017_B029",
      "episode_id": "EP017",
      "file_index": 28,
      "scene_id": "EP017_S01",
      "block_type": "ACTION",
      "label_raw": "ACTION",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:36.50",
      "end_raw": "00:39.00",
      "start_ms": 36500,
      "end_ms": 39000,
      "text": "Alexander squeezes Juliana's hands reassuringly as she rests her fingertips against his skin. The scene fades to black.",
      "line_number": 126,
      "duration_ms": 2500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP017_B030",
      "episode_id": "EP017",
      "file_index": 29,
      "scene_id": "EP017_S02",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:39.00",
      "end_raw": "00:42.00",
      "start_ms": 39000,
      "end_ms": 42000,
      "text": "Medium shot in the warm, flickering firelight of the stone cottage. Juliana kneels on the stone floor beside a washbasin of water while Alexander sits quietly in a chair beside the blazing hearth.",
      "line_number": 137,
      "duration_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP017_B031",
      "episode_id": "EP017",
      "file_index": 30,
      "scene_id": "EP017_S02",
      "block_type": "ACTION",
      "label_raw": "ACTION",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:40.00",
      "end_raw": "00:44.50",
      "start_ms": 40000,
      "end_ms": 44500,
      "text": "Juliana wrings out a clean linen cloth from the basin and tenderly dabs at the fresh cuts and abrasions on the back of Alexander's right hand.",
      "line_number": 141,
      "duration_ms": 4500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP017_B032",
      "episode_id": "EP017",
      "file_index": 31,
      "scene_id": "EP017_S02",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
